    "detailed_description": "Slip into the shadows and outsmart security in this thrilling multiplayer heist game!<br><br><strong>Master Thief</strong> challenges you to become the ultimate burglar in a world where cunning and stealth are your greatest assets.<br><br>\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Features</strong>:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Cunning Heists</strong>: Overcome clever obstacles and solve intricate puzzles to secure your loot.<br></li><li><strong>Cooperative Gameplay</strong>: Team up with friends in multiplayer mode to pull off daring robberies.<br></li><li><strong>Skill Progression</strong>: Embark on a variety of missions to hone your thieving abilities and grow your ill-gotten fortune.<br></li><li><strong>Humorous Twists</strong>: Experience a lighthearted take on the world of high-stakes burglary.</li></ul><br>Do you have what it takes to become the Master Thief? Gather your crew, plan your heist, and prepare for the ultimate test of stealth and strategy!",
